cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Cue v1, please cite it as below."
title: "Cue v1: turn detection from context and audio, with a fine-tuned decision model"
authors:
  - name: "Pype"
date-released: 2026-10-12
version: "1.0.0"
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://huggingface.co/Pype/cue-v1"
repository-code: "https://github.com/PYPE-AI-MAIN/cue-v1"
abstract: >-
  Cue v1 combines the logits of Gemma 4 E4B, fine-tuned on turn-taking decisions (DONE, LIKELY_DONE, MID_THOUGHT,
  HOLDING; STOP or CONTINUE for interruptions), with Smart Turn v3.2's audio score as p_end x sqrt(p_voice).
  Evaluated on LiveKit's eot-bench in 14 languages.
keywords:
  - end-of-turn
  - turn-taking
  - voice-agents
  - decision-model
